OL,3,AEducating Cardiff teacher admits
OL,4,Asexually assaulting teenage girl
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teacher who featured in the Channel 4
OL,7,Fdocumentary series Educating Cardiff
OL,8,Fhas pleaded guilty to sexually
OL,9,Fassaulting a 17-year-old girl.
OL,11,FGareth Ritter, 44, of Bryngwyn, in
OL,12,FMonmouthshire, was in the middle of
OL,13,Fgiving evidence in his defence when his
OL,14,Fbarrister asked for the charge to be
OL,15,Fput to him again.
OL,17,FRitter, who was also a prominent member
OL,18,Fof a number of brass bands, was asked
OL,19,Fto stand up and, when asked how he
OL,20,Fpleaded, he said "guilty".
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
